WEBVTT

00:03.541 --> 00:04.871
You kick them out?

00:05.251 --> 00:09.011
Yeah, the guys we don't need in our guild.

00:09.011 --> 00:11.761
A lot of guilds have been doing it lately.

00:12.141 --> 00:14.011
Maybe we should, too.

00:14.011 --> 00:18.271
Do it, Mister Guildmaster 
of the Beast's Fangs.

00:18.831 --> 00:22.101
Kicking people out is great.

00:22.101 --> 00:24.211
Your personnel expenses go down,

00:24.211 --> 00:29.181
and you don't have to look at 
their stupid faces anymore.

00:31.921 --> 00:34.581
All right!

00:34.581 --> 00:39.351
Then I'll kick someone out, too!

00:54.491 --> 00:56.181
That was a lot of work.

00:56.181 --> 00:59.611
Another successful monster-slaying quest.

00:59.611 --> 01:02.421
You guys are back already?

01:02.421 --> 01:05.071
All we found were weaklings.

01:05.651 --> 01:08.991
<i>They're so lucky they get to fight.</i>

01:09.861 --> 01:11.941
<i>I've never fought before.</i>

01:12.861 --> 01:16.751
<i>I've focused on enhancing 
weapons and equipment</i>

01:16.751 --> 01:19.811
<i>as an enchanter during 
my time with the guild.</i>

01:21.751 --> 01:25.881
Hey, Rein. Quit looking around 
the room and do your job.

01:26.141 --> 01:27.791
Right, sorry.

01:31.521 --> 01:33.471
This ain't bad at all.

01:33.471 --> 01:37.971
With your enchantments, even an ordinary 
sword becomes a legendary blade.

01:37.971 --> 01:39.471
Right?

01:40.681 --> 01:42.451
Oh, right.

01:42.451 --> 01:46.981
Rein, Barrius wanted to see you. Let's go.

01:47.621 --> 01:49.301
The guildmaster?

01:53.241 --> 01:55.241
<i>That shield. That sword.</i>

01:57.051 --> 01:59.491
<i>That armor. That axe.</i>

01:59.491 --> 02:01.961
<i>I enchanted all of them.</i>

02:02.751 --> 02:07.111
<i>I may not go into battle, but I 
contribute to everyone's achievements.</i>

02:08.281 --> 02:12.851
<i>The guildmaster is asking for me. 
I wonder what it's about.</i>

02:12.851 --> 02:16.401
<i>Will I get a raise? Or maybe...</i>

02:16.401 --> 02:22.431
<i>an adventurer traveled from far away to 
ask me to enchant something for them?</i>

02:22.431 --> 02:23.181
You're fired.

02:24.511 --> 02:29.091
With all the powerful weapons and armor 
we have, we don't need you anymore.

02:29.091 --> 02:32.251
All you can do is enchant items. 
You can't even fight.

02:32.251 --> 02:34.201
So naturally, you're fired.

02:34.491 --> 02:37.451
Seriously? That doesn't make any sense!

02:39.151 --> 02:40.111
You're fired.

02:40.531 --> 02:42.261
Come on, you heard him.

02:42.261 --> 02:44.581
Get out of here, useless.

02:44.581 --> 02:46.711
I still haven't accepted this!

02:46.711 --> 02:48.571
That's not our problem.

02:48.571 --> 02:50.461
You wanna fight?! Huh?!

02:52.601 --> 02:54.161
Ow...

02:54.161 --> 02:58.491
I may be inexperienced, but that doesn't 
mean I can't become an adventurer.

02:58.491 --> 02:59.801
Shut up, Rein!

02:59.801 --> 03:02.241
You can't do it!

03:02.241 --> 03:05.731
Nobody wants to adventure with you!

03:05.731 --> 03:09.861
You're just an enchanting one-trick pony!

03:09.861 --> 03:12.741
All our gear's already enchanted!

03:12.741 --> 03:14.861
Of course you're getting cut!

03:14.861 --> 03:16.641
Quit staring, jerk!

03:16.641 --> 03:19.111
Get out of here, loser!

03:20.871 --> 03:22.631
Incompetent!

03:23.231 --> 03:25.151
Go die on the street!

03:25.621 --> 03:26.501
Get outta here!

03:27.281 --> 03:29.471
<i>I thought they were my friends.</i>

03:29.471 --> 03:31.881
<i>Nobody's going to save me?</i>

03:33.631 --> 03:38.271
Well, I've had enough 
of this shitty guild!

03:47.491 --> 03:56.031
THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE
ENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE

04:04.211 --> 04:05.571
Where am I?

04:07.311 --> 04:08.821
What am I even saying?

04:13.451 --> 04:16.051
There's no point in moping forever.

04:19.151 --> 04:22.041
If they're going to do whatever 
they want, then I will, too.

04:23.391 --> 04:26.971
<i>The enchantments I cast 
enhance weapons and armor</i>

04:26.971 --> 04:31.731
<i>by imbuing them with bonus points, 
a special type of mana.</i>

04:33.441 --> 04:34.941
<i>And...</i>

04:38.571 --> 04:40.701
Dispel all the enchantments I cast

04:40.701 --> 04:45.951
on the weapons and armor of the 
512 members of the Beast's Fangs.

05:30.861 --> 05:33.921
<i>I can take back the points I've granted.</i>

05:42.031 --> 05:46.611
<i>These are all bonus points 
I gave to everyone else.</i>

05:47.301 --> 05:51.641
<i>I can't leave them like this. 
I need to put them in something.</i>

05:52.331 --> 05:54.551
This is all I've got on me.

05:52.411 --> 05:54.901
COPPER SWORD (CHEAP)

05:54.901 --> 05:57.701
Okay, let's test it.

06:03.901 --> 06:06.391
I still have 3,033 points left.

06:06.391 --> 06:11.161
Then this is a Copper Sword +10,000.

06:11.161 --> 06:13.531
What should I put points into next?

06:13.531 --> 06:16.481
Armor or a shield? 
But I don't have either.

06:20.841 --> 06:21.941
There.

06:24.401 --> 06:27.641
Plain Clothes +3,033.

06:27.641 --> 06:31.681
I bet they offer more protection 
than standard armor now.

06:31.681 --> 06:33.551
I've enhanced my sword and clothes.

06:33.551 --> 06:37.671
I may be inexperienced, but I should 
be able to fight with just these.

06:40.821 --> 06:44.731
<i>I've never taken a break 
from working until now.</i>

06:44.731 --> 06:49.581
<i>I always wanted to take it 
easy and try adventuring, too.</i>

06:52.481 --> 06:54.381
I could do both now.

06:54.381 --> 06:57.631
I'll earn money adventuring for a guild

06:57.631 --> 07:00.821
and then enjoy my freedom!

07:00.821 --> 07:05.841
EVERYONE KNOWS WHAT IT'S LIKE WHEN NOTHING GOES
RIGHT, BUT WHAT DO I DO WHEN THAT HAPPENS?
 WHY, IT'S OBVIOUS! I RUN AND SCREAM MY HEAD OFF!

07:07.361 --> 07:10.851
KINGDOM OF ZELUGE

07:12.481 --> 07:13.811
Excuse me.

07:13.811 --> 07:17.851
I'm looking for an adventurer's 
guild other than the Beast's Fangs.

07:18.411 --> 07:19.981
This is a bakery.

07:20.311 --> 07:22.521
At least buy something.

07:22.521 --> 07:24.741
Okay, I'll take a croissant.

07:26.341 --> 07:27.861
So, know any guilds?

07:28.141 --> 07:29.861
Can't say I do.

07:31.121 --> 07:33.681
You have a question? Buy something first.

07:33.681 --> 07:35.851
I'll tell you if you buy something.

07:35.851 --> 07:37.621
Buy a mask.

07:39.061 --> 07:42.111
I'm having trouble finding anything.

07:42.111 --> 07:43.131
Hey, you.

07:45.301 --> 07:46.161
Who, me?

07:46.651 --> 07:48.321
Yeah, you.

07:48.321 --> 07:50.391
Who else do you see?

07:50.761 --> 07:52.011
Your money.

07:52.011 --> 07:53.511
Hand it over.

07:53.511 --> 07:56.711
Your equipment and physique 
don't look like much.

07:56.711 --> 07:59.661
You don't wanna get slugged in the 
stomach, do you? Hand it over.

08:02.201 --> 08:04.521
<i>I'm wearing enhanced clothes.</i>

08:04.521 --> 08:07.901
<i>I doubt a punch to the 
stomach would hurt at all.</i>

08:07.901 --> 08:13.241
<i>I want to test the defense 
of my Plain Clothes +3,033!</i>

08:13.241 --> 08:14.661
Hey!

08:14.941 --> 08:17.631
What do you two think you're doing?!

08:18.161 --> 08:19.281
Huh?

08:19.281 --> 08:20.831
Who the hell are you?

08:21.741 --> 08:25.551
It doesn't matter who I am. 
Your behavior is the bigger problem.

08:25.551 --> 08:29.301
What? We're just talking to our friend.

08:29.571 --> 08:31.841
I-In any case, I'm calling for help.

08:33.611 --> 08:37.601
What was that, bitch? 
You wanna get beaten first?

08:39.081 --> 08:40.601
Wait.

08:41.011 --> 08:42.791
You're dealing with me.

08:42.791 --> 08:46.981
Thanks for the help, but step back.

08:47.791 --> 08:51.281
I want to get punched in 
the stomach right now!

08:52.241 --> 08:54.981
<i>What is he saying?</i>

08:56.201 --> 08:59.271
Wait, that'll hurt a lot! Don't do it!

08:59.271 --> 09:03.201
Shut up! Just let me let them punch me!

09:03.201 --> 09:05.461
Let you let them... What are you saying?!

09:06.751 --> 09:10.541
You wanna get punched 
in the stomach, huh?!

09:13.601 --> 09:14.801
It doesn't hurt.

09:14.801 --> 09:18.561
Ow! That's hard as hell!

09:15.071 --> 09:24.101
AAAAAUGH

09:21.611 --> 09:24.101
Why are you horrified, too?!

09:24.411 --> 09:28.111
You'll pay for this, brat!

09:28.111 --> 09:31.871
We'll get you!

09:33.321 --> 09:35.741
Do you have a metal plate under there?

09:35.741 --> 09:39.341
I enhanced my clothes 
with 3,033 bonus points.

09:39.341 --> 09:43.371
Yeah, yeah. A likely story.

09:43.371 --> 09:44.711
Are you an adventurer?

09:45.031 --> 09:47.341
Yeah. I'm Rein.

09:47.341 --> 09:49.461
I'm Nina.

09:49.821 --> 09:54.221
By the way, Nina, are there any 
adventurer's guilds around here?

09:54.221 --> 09:56.481
You're looking for a guild?

09:57.021 --> 10:00.721
Then why not join the Blue Crystals?

10:00.721 --> 10:03.851
I've never heard of them. 
Are they really from around here?

10:03.851 --> 10:07.841
Yes, we are! I'm a receptionist 
for the Blue Crystals!

10:09.931 --> 10:12.741
If you'd like, I can go with you.

10:13.121 --> 10:15.961
I'm on my way back right now.

10:16.661 --> 10:18.911
I see. In that case, lead the way.

10:20.221 --> 10:21.891
Try not to be surprised, though.

10:21.891 --> 10:22.751
By what?

10:22.751 --> 10:25.281
You'll see when we get there.

10:30.231 --> 10:32.311
DECREPIT

10:35.661 --> 10:39.811
Disappointed? Changed your 
mind about joining us?

10:39.811 --> 10:44.431
No, Nina. I'll register 
as an adventurer here.

10:44.431 --> 10:46.221
What?! Really?!

10:46.221 --> 10:46.851
Yeah.

10:46.851 --> 10:49.171
You'll register as an adventurer with us?!

10:49.171 --> 10:51.271
I already said I would!

10:51.271 --> 10:53.291
Master, big news!

10:53.291 --> 10:56.501
Someone would like to 
register with the guild!

10:57.151 --> 11:00.421
What?! No way!

11:01.411 --> 11:05.371
Are you sure it's not the usual, 
"This isn't the Beast's Fangs?

11:05.371 --> 11:10.441
You're a different guild? Never mind," 
and then they leave?

11:14.131 --> 11:18.361
I want to join your guild 
because I left the Beast's Fangs.

11:19.941 --> 11:23.201
Yes! Nice work, Nina!

11:25.141 --> 11:28.941
I'm Elsie, guildmaster 
of the Blue Crystals.

11:28.941 --> 11:30.161
Nice to meet you.

11:30.481 --> 11:32.021
Yo.

11:35.641 --> 11:38.491
Well, I'll be working in the back.

11:38.491 --> 11:41.291
If you need anything, 
don't hesitate to ask.

11:41.291 --> 11:45.401
Elsie is happy to lend an ear anytime.

11:45.401 --> 11:47.881
Take care of the rest, Nina.

11:47.881 --> 11:49.371
Okay.

11:50.031 --> 11:53.751
That's all on intermediary 
fees and rewards.

11:53.751 --> 11:57.091
Sign here, and you'll be 
registered as an adventurer.

11:57.091 --> 11:58.181
Got it.

11:59.681 --> 12:02.641
Wait, this isn't the Beast's Fangs?

12:02.641 --> 12:05.641
Of course it isn't. 
Just look at this dump.

12:05.641 --> 12:06.391
Hey!

12:07.971 --> 12:12.151
We'll let you choose. Hand over your 
money, or we'll destroy the place.

12:12.151 --> 12:13.821
Wh-What?

12:13.821 --> 12:17.521
The job we accepted here 
the other day was awful.

12:17.521 --> 12:20.161
We'll forgive you if you pay us.

12:20.161 --> 12:24.081
Or you can hand that guy over.

12:24.081 --> 12:25.381
Let's do that.

12:25.701 --> 12:28.711
Okay, step outside.

12:28.711 --> 12:29.721
Sure.

12:31.101 --> 12:32.761
Wait, Rein!

12:32.761 --> 12:34.391
What are you going to do?

12:34.391 --> 12:36.421
They seem to have business with me.

12:36.421 --> 12:38.211
You really shouldn't do this!

12:38.211 --> 12:40.551
You're only strong against 
stomach punches, right?

12:40.551 --> 12:43.461
Don't worry. I took two 
guys on earlier, too.

12:43.461 --> 12:45.061
I'm sure I can handle these two—

12:50.811 --> 12:53.441
We're here to pay you back, brat!

12:53.441 --> 12:55.711
We heard what you did to our friend!

12:55.711 --> 12:57.571
Who do you think we are, punk?!

13:00.761 --> 13:04.251
Rein, run! You won't get off with 
just a stomach punch this time!

13:04.251 --> 13:06.071
It's okay, Nina.

13:06.071 --> 13:11.001
I thought something like this might 
happen and prepared the ultimate weapon.

13:12.931 --> 13:14.211
It's tiny!

13:14.211 --> 13:16.501
There's no way! You can't fight with that!

13:16.501 --> 13:19.461
It's tiny! What even is that?!

13:19.461 --> 13:22.701
This has been enchanted 
with 10,000 bonus points.

13:22.701 --> 13:26.671
Small doesn't always 
mean weak. Right, Nina?

13:26.671 --> 13:30.441
What can you even do 
with that tiny sword?!

13:31.181 --> 13:35.421
Hey! Stop pulling on me, Nina!

13:57.931 --> 13:59.121
What was that?

13:59.121 --> 14:00.911
What's his deal?

14:00.911 --> 14:02.601
He's crazy.

14:02.921 --> 14:05.051
He's a monster! Run!

14:09.951 --> 14:13.191
Rein, what did you just do?

14:13.551 --> 14:15.781
I just swung my sword a little.

14:16.211 --> 14:17.681
What are you talking about?

14:27.161 --> 14:30.111
No bystanders got caught in the blast.

14:30.111 --> 14:32.491
I see. That's good.

14:32.491 --> 14:33.581
Yeah, seriously!

14:33.581 --> 14:36.461
You just need to be careful 
going forward, Rein.

14:36.461 --> 14:37.891
Master!

14:38.401 --> 14:39.841
I will.

14:40.141 --> 14:43.641
You're a member of the Blue Crystals now.

14:43.641 --> 14:47.201
Our members will help you 
and teach you things.

14:47.201 --> 14:50.061
Some of them have been 
adventuring for a long time.

14:50.061 --> 14:54.731
That's right. I'm sure you can 
learn to use your power well.

14:55.681 --> 14:56.891
I see!

14:56.891 --> 14:57.981
Rein.

14:59.341 --> 15:02.391
You're going to become 
an incredible adventurer.

15:03.661 --> 15:06.441
Welcome to the Blue Crystals.

15:08.561 --> 15:11.791
The Blue Crystals covered 
the 1,000 gold needed

15:11.791 --> 15:15.121
to repair the street and 
buildings you destroyed.

15:15.121 --> 15:17.871
O-One thousand?!

15:18.191 --> 15:20.881
<i>How many years of earnings is that for me?</i>

15:22.411 --> 15:23.891
Don't worry.

15:23.891 --> 15:27.471
You can pay it back while working for me.

15:27.471 --> 15:30.041
Oh, that works!

15:30.041 --> 15:33.141
Nina, got any jobs that pay 1,000 gold?

15:33.971 --> 15:38.271
Rein, you can't do quests 
like that without experience.

15:38.561 --> 15:42.431
Nina, we've got that job 
we've been ignoring.

15:42.431 --> 15:47.521
Master, I really don't think 
Rein's ready for that.

15:47.521 --> 15:48.781
What are you talking about?

15:52.861 --> 15:54.621
Dragon slaying.

15:55.121 --> 15:55.781
Dra...

15:59.181 --> 16:01.631
We received the request two weeks ago.

16:01.631 --> 16:04.651
The client has reached 
out to other guilds, too,

16:04.651 --> 16:07.761
but everyone's busy, 
so no one's accepted it.

16:07.761 --> 16:08.881
A dragon!

16:08.881 --> 16:11.091
But you're not ready for that.

16:11.091 --> 16:14.461
Most adventurers can't beat a dragon.

16:14.461 --> 16:20.391
Typically, people don't take on dragons 
without a few years of experience, so...

16:20.391 --> 16:22.911
Why not take on the dragon? Go for it.

16:22.911 --> 16:25.321
I'll be working in the back.

16:25.321 --> 16:27.291
Please, Master...

16:27.291 --> 16:29.531
The client's waiting, right?

16:29.791 --> 16:31.911
Someone's gotta go.

16:34.291 --> 16:37.621
<i>He's going to slay a dragon while dressed 
like he's taking a dog on a walk?</i>

16:37.621 --> 16:38.871
<i>He can't be serious.</i>

16:39.131 --> 16:43.001
Nina, my equipment alone 
makes me pretty strong.

16:43.661 --> 16:46.001
This sword has 10,000 bonus points.

16:46.001 --> 16:48.701
These clothes have 3,033 bonus points.

16:48.701 --> 16:51.281
They should be stronger than steel armor.

16:51.281 --> 16:53.011
If you're worried, 
try stabbing me with a knife!

16:53.011 --> 16:55.141
I can't do that!

17:01.501 --> 17:02.741
It's true.

17:03.941 --> 17:06.061
It's stronger than steel armor.

17:08.131 --> 17:09.441
Right?

17:09.441 --> 17:13.081
Thanks! Did you see that, Nina?

17:13.081 --> 17:15.701
<i>You should be angry she 
hit you with a sword.</i>

17:15.701 --> 17:17.581
By the way, who are you?

17:18.821 --> 17:21.961
I'm Lily. Lily Flambert.

17:22.341 --> 17:25.211
Lily Flambert?

17:25.211 --> 17:30.471
Nina, if you're worried about sending 
him by himself, I'll go with him.

17:30.471 --> 17:32.241
But Lily, you...

17:32.241 --> 17:34.841
I'll be fine, Nina.

17:34.841 --> 17:38.351
Have you forgotten that 
I'm an S-rank adventurer?

17:38.351 --> 17:39.441
I'm D-rank.

17:39.441 --> 17:42.231
Yeah, I wouldn't bother telling 
people about your shitty rank.

17:42.571 --> 17:45.181
Now, let's go. Rein, was it?

17:45.181 --> 17:46.231
Yeah.

17:47.401 --> 17:49.711
Wait, wait! I need to 
confer with the master—

17:49.711 --> 17:52.491
Huh? Hey!

18:07.761 --> 18:10.201
This city has changed a lot.

18:10.911 --> 18:16.751
<i>Lily Flambert is a swordsman who became 
the youngest S-rank adventurer ever.</i>

18:17.961 --> 18:20.851
Her name is known across the continent.

18:21.681 --> 18:25.231
When she was seven, 
she slew five low-level dragons.

18:25.541 --> 18:29.731
When she was twelve, she tamed 
and rode a mid-level dragon.

18:30.501 --> 18:37.671
She eventually became powerful enough 
to defeat high-level dragons by herself,

18:37.991 --> 18:41.901
but for the past few years, 
we've heard nothing of her exploits.

18:42.581 --> 18:46.271
I'd heard rumors about you 
being crippled or dead,

18:46.271 --> 18:48.901
but you've been here all along, huh?

18:48.901 --> 18:52.761
I'm right here. You don't need 
to tell me my life story.

18:52.761 --> 18:56.011
What's an adventurer like you 
doing with the Blue Crystals?

19:01.261 --> 19:02.521
It's a good guild.

19:04.191 --> 19:09.401
That's true. Thanks for 
coming with me, Lily.

19:12.131 --> 19:14.561
I don't deserve your thanks.

19:14.561 --> 19:18.361
If you'd gone alone and died, 
the guild would be in trouble.

19:20.501 --> 19:26.201
They'd be criticized for sending a total 
novice by himself to slay a dragon.

19:26.811 --> 19:28.771
That's why I'm going with you.

19:29.381 --> 19:35.661
I focused on enchanting, 
so I've never fought before.

19:36.011 --> 19:39.331
Let me know if you need any enchantments.

19:46.771 --> 19:48.291
That's a magic sword.

19:48.611 --> 19:49.831
Correct.

19:49.831 --> 19:53.651
It's unsigned, but it's a powerful blade 
forged using magic techniques.

19:53.951 --> 19:54.901
In that case...

19:56.481 --> 19:57.411
Lily?

19:57.411 --> 20:00.141
I don't need your enchantments.

20:00.141 --> 20:01.791
Let's hurry.

20:04.761 --> 20:07.971
SEVERAL HOURS LATER...

20:07.811 --> 20:10.171
Looks like a mid-level dragon.

20:10.171 --> 20:12.131
A dragon?! Where?!

20:12.131 --> 20:13.761
It's not here.

20:13.761 --> 20:15.951
I can just tell from the 
scale of the damage.

20:15.951 --> 20:19.881
Wow, Lily! You're a real adventurer!

20:19.881 --> 20:22.451
I just know from experience.

20:22.831 --> 20:26.181
You'll pick things up while adventuring 
whether you like it or not.

20:26.181 --> 20:27.891
Let's hurry!

20:27.891 --> 20:29.211
Where are you going?

20:29.211 --> 20:31.521
To the dragon! Dragon, dragon, go, go!

20:31.521 --> 20:34.401
It's not that way. It's this way.

20:35.581 --> 20:36.691
You know that from experience, too?

20:36.691 --> 20:39.041
Stop shouting about everything!

20:39.041 --> 20:40.391
Lily!

20:40.391 --> 20:41.661
What now?

20:55.891 --> 20:56.921
Soon.

21:00.061 --> 21:02.191
It could appear at any time.

21:13.921 --> 21:15.321
What's wrong, Lily?

21:16.811 --> 21:19.381
Just ignore me.

21:19.781 --> 21:23.871
Go slay the dragon or whatever 
it is you want to do.

21:23.871 --> 21:26.541
I can't do that.

21:26.541 --> 21:29.871
If you're not feeling well, 
let's leave so we can rest.

21:30.291 --> 21:37.461
Rein, you don't know what I've been 
doing these past two years, do you?

21:37.461 --> 21:39.591
I sure don't.

21:41.261 --> 21:44.221
You want to know what I was doing?

21:46.351 --> 21:48.721
I was doing nothing!

21:49.041 --> 21:52.511
Huh? Wh-What are you talking about?

21:52.981 --> 21:55.491
You weren't doing anything?

21:55.491 --> 22:00.101
You defeated low-level dragons at seven, 
tamed mid-level dragons at twelve,

22:00.101 --> 22:03.521
and became the youngest S-rank 
adventurer ever, right?

22:03.941 --> 22:05.071
You stupid idiot!

22:05.071 --> 22:09.311
Shut up, shut up, shut up!
